{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17214300","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17214300","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721430001:0":{"text":"꼬마야, 항상 흰장갑을 끼는 언니를 본 적 있니?","source_cn":"小妹妹，你见没见过一个经常戴白手套的姐姐？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2A07F04E9884E92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721430002:0":{"text":"엄청 예쁜 언니죠? 알아요! 맨날 제가 본 적도 없는 옷만 입는! 그런데...","source_cn":"见过！那个姐姐很漂亮！穿的都是我没见过的衣服！不过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A4F97F34320A34A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721430003:0":{"text":"그런데?","source_cn":"不过什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FDBD6C4DC3C0408","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721430004:0":{"text":"너무 말랐어요. 그래서 엄마가 그 언니를 볼 때마다 저한테 밥 안 먹으면 저렇게 된다고 해요.","source_cn":"她太瘦了，每次见到她，妈妈都会让我多吃点，说不能像那位...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5101007CDB26FE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721430005:0":{"text":"듀라 님이시여... 최근에는 본 적 있니?","source_cn":"艾雅在上……那你最近见过她吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9097CE2D91D33A4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_